(1778807, 241881, 44214, '<td valign="top">Great photo but I would have cropped it more.</td>', 'Great photo but I would have cropped it more.', '2005-10-12 06:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778809, 243040, 44214, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea!</td>', 'Interesting idea!', '2005-10-12 06:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778823, 241357, 29168, '<td valign="top">The human/parental pride is powerful in this shit, but I feel a tighter crop to remove more of the bottom and right would help a lot. Also, on my screen, the chest and baby''s head are very dark. cropping out the blanket and shirt more would have allowed brightening the middle and upper areas. I''m sure there were more important things on your mind at the time though :)</td>', 'The human/parental pride is powerful in this shit, but I feel a tighter crop to remove more of the bottom and right would help a lot. Also, on my screen, the chest and baby''s head are very dark. cropping out the blanket and shirt more would have allowed brightening the middle and upper areas. I''m sure there were more important things on your mind at the time though :)', '2005-10-12 06:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778826, 241338, 21816, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this photo but I would of liked it slightly brighter. The colouring is interesting (whether intentional or accidental) and works ok. Well done.</td>', 'I like the idea of this photo but I would of liked it slightly brighter. The colouring is interesting (whether intentional or accidental) and works ok. Well done.', '2005-10-12 06:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778827, 241902, 29168, '<td valign="top">After taking about a zillion mountain shots I finally decided they just never work in portrait for some reason -- even though you''d think it would highlight the height. Then I realised it was about the amount of sky above the peak. Too much sky makes the mountain look much lower than it is. (IMO) 5 and good luck!</td>', 'After taking about a zillion mountain shots I finally decided they just never work in portrait for some reason -- even though you''d think it would highlight the height. Then I realised it was about the amount of sky above the peak. Too much sky makes the mountain look much lower than it is. (IMO) 5 and good luck!', '2005-10-12 06:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778828, 242097, 21816, '<td valign="top">Smart Arse! :)</td>', 'Smart Arse! :)', '2005-10-12 07:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778832, 242383, 29168, '<td valign="top">The narrow depth of field here would have really worked well, softening the pumpkins and ground features to highlight the subject.. What a shame the focus falls to the fore of the main subject. 6. Good luck!</td>', 'The narrow depth of field here would have really worked well, softening the pumpkins and ground features to highlight the subject.. What a shame the focus falls to the fore of the main subject. 6. Good luck!', '2005-10-12 07:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778852, 242895, 43405, '<td valign="top">Photograph is just too blured</td>', 'Photograph is just too blured', '2005-10-12 07:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778856, 243071, 43405, '<td valign="top">Colors work well in this photograph, well done</td>', 'Colors work well in this photograph, well done', '2005-10-12 07:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778858, 240933, 31889, '<td valign="top">Man if only you used the full 640 pixels on the long side.</td>', 'Man if only you used the full 640 pixels on the long side.', '2005-10-12 07:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778860, 243011, 31889, '<td valign="top">Thats a fresh one....congrats.</td>', 'Thats a fresh one....congrats.', '2005-10-12 07:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
