(1778889, 242527, 31889, '<td valign="top">I think I recognise that body from a portfolio I was just viewing.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I think I recognise that body from a portfolio I was just viewing.  Nice shot.', '2005-10-12 07:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778894, 243027, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great shot..love your composition.</td>', 'Great shot..love your composition.', '2005-10-12 07:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778902, 242628, 35229, '<td valign="top">Same picture again?? It was in another challenge cropped little diffrently. I think this is not working up sorry.</td>', 'Same picture again?? It was in another challenge cropped little diffrently. I think this is not working up sorry.', '2005-10-12 08:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778927, 241893, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful coloring!</td>', 'Wonderful coloring!', '2005-10-12 08:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778951, 242103, 43077, '<td valign="top">Dont see a sense of pride in that one.</td>', 'Dont see a sense of pride in that one.', '2005-10-12 08:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778954, 243030, 21816, '<td valign="top">I guess the border goes with the dress sense! :p</td>', 'I guess the border goes with the dress sense! :p', '2005-10-12 08:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778955, 243088, 43077, '<td valign="top">errr, mmmm, no... If i had seen this pic without knowing the challenge was pride, I would never of guessed.</td>', 'errr, mmmm, no... If i had seen this pic without knowing the challenge was pride, I would never of guessed.', '2005-10-12 08:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778956, 242582, 43077, '<td valign="top">Pride??!</td>', 'Pride??!', '2005-10-12 08:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778960, 242461, 43077, '<td valign="top">nice pic. The lioness definitely portrays pride. -8</td>', 'nice pic. The lioness definitely portrays pride. -8', '2005-10-12 08:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778966, 242240, 43077, '<td valign="top">I fail to see the connection with pride.</td>', 'I fail to see the connection with pride.', '2005-10-12 08:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778974, 242820, 21816, '<td valign="top">I like the tones in the face but I don''t like the border that big!</td>', 'I like the tones in the face but I don''t like the border that big!', '2005-10-12 08:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779013, 242826, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is good!</td>', 'this is good!', '2005-10-12 09:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779014, 242392, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute! you could have gone bigger</td>', 'cute! you could have gone bigger', '2005-10-12 09:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779018, 240709, 16241, '<td valign="top">awwwwwwwww!  8</td>', 'awwwwwwwww!  8', '2005-10-12 09:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779020, 242896, 33732, '<td valign="top">Did John Muir go here?  Nice photo.  The snow could be brighter but you may need a ND filter for the sky.</td>', 'Did John Muir go here?  Nice photo.  The snow could be brighter but you may need a ND filter for the sky.', '2005-10-12 09:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779021, 240941, 16241, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2005-10-12 09:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779025, 241324, 33732, '<td valign="top">Not so sharp.  I like the photo but if I get 4 feet back from the CRT is it better.</td>', 'Not so sharp.  I like the photo but if I get 4 feet back from the CRT is it better.', '2005-10-12 09:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779047, 242628, 33732, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  The house does not add but gives me idea of what the planes were doing.  A different crop maybe to reduce the house.  The roof is ok.  I blocked off the right side to reduce the white.  Cut the window out.  That puts the planes in the upper right.  I am thinking the original photo is clear and nice looking.  8</td>', 'Excellent.  The house does not add but gives me idea of what the planes were doing.  A different crop maybe to reduce the house.  The roof is ok.  I blocked off the right side to reduce the white.  Cut the window out.  That puts the planes in the upper right.  I am thinking the original photo is clear and nice looking.  8', '2005-10-12 09:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779061, 241937, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh MY!</td>', 'Oh MY!', '2005-10-12 09:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779070, 241818, 36158, '<td valign="top">Well done. Awesome lighting.</td>', 'Well done. Awesome lighting.', '2005-10-12 09:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779096, 242853, 30049, '<td valign="top">Overall I like the feel of this image.  B/W was a good choice.  It''s a shame about the powerlines.  ;^(   Wonder how this might have looked in a full silhouette?  The rider is already pretty dark.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Overall I like the feel of this image.  B/W was a good choice.  It''s a shame about the powerlines.  ;^(   Wonder how this might have looked in a full silhouette?  The rider is already pretty dark.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-12 10:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779106, 241700, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious.  I love that he''s advertising not only Coke and Nike, but the Chicago bulls and the burger joint from where they came. LOL  The sepia filter is terrific. The composition is good, although I wish the guy weren''t so centered.  Thanks for the chuckle.  8</td>', 'This is hilarious.  I love that he''s advertising not only Coke and Nike, but the Chicago bulls and the burger joint from where they came. LOL  The sepia filter is terrific. The composition is good, although I wish the guy weren''t so centered.  Thanks for the chuckle.  8', '2005-10-12 10:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779107, 243030, 15711, '<td valign="top">No, you certainly don''t. ROFL<br/></td>', 'No, you certainly don''t. ROFL', '2005-10-12 10:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779109, 240898, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the light.  I  think I''d crop just below the elbow.  But the use of negative space is interesting. Good clarity of the eyes.  I like this.</td>', 'I love the light.  I  think I''d crop just below the elbow.  But the use of negative space is interesting. Good clarity of the eyes.  I like this.', '2005-10-12 10:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779114, 243152, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE  Nothing like a proud chicken.  I love it.  Nice and different.  Good clarity and detail.</td>', 'HEE HEE  Nothing like a proud chicken.  I love it.  Nice and different.  Good clarity and detail.', '2005-10-12 10:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779118, 241358, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the title, but I surely like the photo.  The hands are quite clear and the placement of them by the book is well done.</td>', 'I don''t really get the title, but I surely like the photo.  The hands are quite clear and the placement of them by the book is well done.', '2005-10-12 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779120, 242890, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE  I like this portrait. You did a good job - it''s fun and different. The skin tones seem maybe a touch yellow? I can''t put my finger on it. Otherwise, well done. 8</td>', 'HEE HEE  I like this portrait. You did a good job - it''s fun and different. The skin tones seem maybe a touch yellow? I can''t put my finger on it. Otherwise, well done. 8', '2005-10-12 10:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779121, 240909, 45725, '<td valign="top">Maybe if the rest of the leaves were green as well....??</td>', 'Maybe if the rest of the leaves were green as well....??', '2005-10-12 10:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779123, 242344, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE I like the DOF. I might''ve left more space to the right - the crop seems a tad tight.</td>', 'HEE HEE I like the DOF. I might''ve left more space to the right - the crop seems a tad tight.', '2005-10-12 10:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779126, 241008, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the lighting and the baby''s hands.  This is natural and totally unposed.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice. I love the lighting and the baby''s hands.  This is natural and totally unposed.  Well done.', '2005-10-12 10:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779127, 242263, 45725, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  However it is my understanding that Native Americans can''t grow facial hair....?</td>', 'Good shot.  However it is my understanding that Native Americans can''t grow facial hair....?', '2005-10-12 10:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779129, 241284, 40344, '<td valign="top">Of course, how clever ...</td>', 'Of course, how clever ...', '2005-10-12 10:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779130, 242300, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I wish there were more space around the red leaf - the crop is a tad tight. I like the detail and focus.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I wish there were more space around the red leaf - the crop is a tad tight. I like the detail and focus.', '2005-10-12 10:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779132, 243096, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and color.  The focus seems to be just a tad bit off.</td>', 'Nice lighting and color.  The focus seems to be just a tad bit off.', '2005-10-12 10:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779136, 241762, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice natural pose.  I wish the baby was looking at the camera too, but the title is all about the uncle and he''s captured quite well. The crop seems just a bit tight. Good DOF.</td>', 'Nice natural pose.  I wish the baby was looking at the camera too, but the title is all about the uncle and he''s captured quite well. The crop seems just a bit tight. Good DOF.', '2005-10-12 10:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779137, 242707, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. Great eyes. I''m trying to figure out what the elyptical reflection is. The dry lips are a tad distracting.  Some chap stick perhaps?  Lovely child.  Beautiful lighting and skin tones.</td>', 'Nice close up. Great eyes. I''m trying to figure out what the elyptical reflection is. The dry lips are a tad distracting.  Some chap stick perhaps?  Lovely child.  Beautiful lighting and skin tones.', '2005-10-12 10:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779142, 240933, 15711, '<td valign="top">What an endearing photo. I''d suggest using the maximum 640 pixelation so that we could see a larger photo. Also, if you save for web, you can up the overall size of the photo. Beautiful baby.  The light bouncing off of the mom''s nose is wonderful. I like her expression. Kind of like "Look what I just did!" Congratulations.</td>', 'What an endearing photo. I''d suggest using the maximum 640 pixelation so that we could see a larger photo. Also, if you save for web, you can up the overall size of the photo. Beautiful baby.  The light bouncing off of the mom''s nose is wonderful. I like her expression. Kind of like "Look what I just did!" Congratulations.', '2005-10-12 10:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779143, 243028, 15711, '<td valign="top">Darling little girl.  Nice close up. I wish it were a touch more sharp. I''d love to see some glint in her eye as well. The DOF is good and the blue denim jacket adds a nice contrast to the golden tones in her hair. 7</td>', 'Darling little girl.  Nice close up. I wish it were a touch more sharp. I''d love to see some glint in her eye as well. The DOF is good and the blue denim jacket adds a nice contrast to the golden tones in her hair. 7', '2005-10-12 10:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779144, 243039, 15711, '<td valign="top">I liked this the minute I saw it.  Good ol'' George with his cherry tree axe.  The silhouette is nicely placed.  Maybe even more space to the left and a tighter crop to the right would have worked for me.  Nice sunset colors. 7</td>', 'I liked this the minute I saw it.  Good ol'' George with his cherry tree axe.  The silhouette is nicely placed.  Maybe even more space to the left and a tighter crop to the right would have worked for me.  Nice sunset colors. 7', '2005-10-12 10:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779146, 242900, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting of this.  The movement of the hammer coming down is well achieved. Although I see that the fire is an integral part, I find it distracting as it is the bright part of the shot and I think we should be focusing on the guy. Maybe shoot from a different angle with the fire out of focus and more behind him, so we still know it''s there, but zoom in on him more. Just a suggestion. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the lighting of this.  The movement of the hammer coming down is well achieved. Although I see that the fire is an integral part, I find it distracting as it is the bright part of the shot and I think we should be focusing on the guy. Maybe shoot from a different angle with the fire out of focus and more behind him, so we still know it''s there, but zoom in on him more. Just a suggestion. Good luck.', '2005-10-12 10:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779148, 242092, 15711, '<td valign="top">He looks genuinely pleased.  I think this is really cute. Good DOF.  I''d give more negative space around him - the crop seems a tad tight.</td>', 'He looks genuinely pleased.  I think this is really cute. Good DOF.  I''d give more negative space around him - the crop seems a tad tight.', '2005-10-12 10:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779149, 242895, 45725, '<td valign="top">huh?</td>', 'huh?', '2005-10-12 10:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779153, 241357, 45725, '<td valign="top">wtf?</td>', 'wtf?', '2005-10-12 10:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779158, 242832, 45816, '<td valign="top">I think she looks kind of self-conscious rather than proud? It''s the positioning and tension of the hands.</td>', 'I think she looks kind of self-conscious rather than proud? It''s the positioning and tension of the hands.', '2005-10-12 10:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779162, 242998, 29039, '<td valign="top">nice concept. Too much neat Image.</td>', 'nice concept. Too much neat Image.', '2005-10-12 10:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779165, 242654, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the colors. Family is indeed a source of pride. If the highlights from the flash were less harsh and maybe a bit sharper on the edges of the frame, I would have scored this higher. Again though, nicely done in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the composition and the colors. Family is indeed a source of pride. If the highlights from the flash were less harsh and maybe a bit sharper on the edges of the frame, I would have scored this higher. Again though, nicely done in my opinion.', '2005-10-12 10:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779171, 242860, 41675, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a very cool looking automobile. For me, I wish it was against a lighter background or some brighter day to really show off the sleekness and color.</td>', 'Congratulations on a very cool looking automobile. For me, I wish it was against a lighter background or some brighter day to really show off the sleekness and color.', '2005-10-12 10:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779175, 241818, 45816, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2005-10-12 10:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779177, 241440, 41675, '<td valign="top">Day five without something or day five of some sort of medical therapy??? I''m trying to discern the pride from this photo, but I''m having difficulty. I''m not a fan of grainy photos, and the yellow tones and highlight areas make the subject appear quite sickly.</td>', 'Day five without something or day five of some sort of medical therapy??? I''m trying to discern the pride from this photo, but I''m having difficulty. I''m not a fan of grainy photos, and the yellow tones and highlight areas make the subject appear quite sickly.', '2005-10-12 10:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779178, 243088, 41675, '<td valign="top">Definitely something to be proud of in my book. Congratulations. I like the border and the extended hand in the foreground. I wish there was just a bit more light on the ring to highlight it further, but again, nicely done.</td>', 'Definitely something to be proud of in my book. Congratulations. I like the border and the extended hand in the foreground. I wish there was just a bit more light on the ring to highlight it further, but again, nicely done.', '2005-10-12 10:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779186, 240683, 40580, '<td valign="top">Witty</td>', 'Witty', '2005-10-12 10:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
