(1779552, 241440, 37875, '<td valign="top">wow!  i love this.  this makes me think of how hard it is to give something up, how horrible it feels, yet how much pride there is in every milestone...the first five minutes, the first five days...i fear that many voters will not view this as an artistic shot, but i do, and i wish you luck.  8</td>', 'wow!  i love this.  this makes me think of how hard it is to give something up, how horrible it feels, yet how much pride there is in every milestone...the first five minutes, the first five days...i fear that many voters will not view this as an artistic shot, but i do, and i wish you luck.  8', '2005-10-12 12:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
