(1779912, 242103, 33732, '<td valign="top">I like this exposure.  The Flag is the focal point.  Good luck.<br/></td>', 'I like this exposure.  The Flag is the focal point.  Good luck.', '2005-10-12 14:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779958, 240933, 44511, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is beautiful!</td>', 'Your lighting is beautiful!', '2005-10-12 14:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779966, 243114, 44511, '<td valign="top">The texture is great!</td>', 'The texture is great!', '2005-10-12 14:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779968, 242364, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the way the sky fades to white on the right side, especially since it is so dark on the left side. I also think this would have looked better without the white border.</td>', 'I don''t like the way the sky fades to white on the right side, especially since it is so dark on the left side. I also think this would have looked better without the white border.', '2005-10-12 14:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779970, 241902, 19633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice concept and a creative take on the theme. Technically, I think this scene could have benefited from a split ND filter. The sky and hill behind the farmhouse are very light, especially when compared to the foreground which seems a little underexposed.</td>', 'This is a nice concept and a creative take on the theme. Technically, I think this scene could have benefited from a split ND filter. The sky and hill behind the farmhouse are very light, especially when compared to the foreground which seems a little underexposed.', '2005-10-12 14:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779972, 242875, 44511, '<td valign="top">I just wish the focus was a little sharper</td>', 'I just wish the focus was a little sharper', '2005-10-12 14:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779978, 243091, 19633, '<td valign="top">I struggle with the composition of this picture. Do I look at the flag or the flare? I think it''s okay to have two points of interest, but I don''t think it works in this picture. Sorry I can''t be more specific.</td>', 'I struggle with the composition of this picture. Do I look at the flag or the flare? I think it''s okay to have two points of interest, but I don''t think it works in this picture. Sorry I can''t be more specific.', '2005-10-12 14:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779979, 243152, 43565, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure chickens are proud of their babies, but I will assume this one is. As for composition, I think maybe a white background on the outside of the fence would have been better, and I wish the front chick wasn''t covering the face of the back chick.</td>', 'I''m not sure chickens are proud of their babies, but I will assume this one is. As for composition, I think maybe a white background on the outside of the fence would have been better, and I wish the front chick wasn''t covering the face of the back chick.', '2005-10-12 14:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779981, 242402, 19633, '<td valign="top">I think the picture of the watch would have benefited from diffusing the light. You would be able to retain the light and dark spots without washing out the detail.</td>', 'I think the picture of the watch would have benefited from diffusing the light. You would be able to retain the light and dark spots without washing out the detail.', '2005-10-12 14:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779983, 242998, 19633, '<td valign="top">I''ve been casting votes for quite a few pictures now and this is the first one I actually see what the subject is proud of. Nice job.</td>', 'I''ve been casting votes for quite a few pictures now and this is the first one I actually see what the subject is proud of. Nice job.', '2005-10-12 14:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779991, 241903, 19633, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, standing proud. Nice interpretation. Horizontal framing was a good choice for the composition. What''s with the fuzzy thing in the foreground though? It''s distracting.</td>', 'Ahhh, standing proud. Nice interpretation. Horizontal framing was a good choice for the composition. What''s with the fuzzy thing in the foreground though? It''s distracting.', '2005-10-12 14:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779992, 243027, 44511, '<td valign="top">Love the monochromatic feel to this!</td>', 'Love the monochromatic feel to this!', '2005-10-12 14:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779996, 242818, 19633, '<td valign="top">So very good, except for your shadow!</td>', 'So very good, except for your shadow!', '2005-10-12 14:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780001, 242300, 5112, '<td valign="top">Yeah!</td>', 'Yeah!', '2005-10-12 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780019, 241338, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting but it just seems too orange on my monitor.</td>', 'I like the lighting but it just seems too orange on my monitor.', '2005-10-12 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780037, 243088, 19633, '<td valign="top">2 carrats is definitely something to be proud of. I can''t help but wonder if the expression on the wearer''s face would have been a stronger indicator of pride than a shot of the ring.</td>', '2 carrats is definitely something to be proud of. I can''t help but wonder if the expression on the wearer''s face would have been a stronger indicator of pride than a shot of the ring.', '2005-10-12 14:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780038, 242254, 43565, '<td valign="top">Go, Rice!  Oops, wrong team! lol  <br/>This seems too much like a snapshot to me. Maybe a solid background and cropping out the other people this would have worked. I predict there will be a lot of DPCers that will not get this at all!</td>', 'Go, Rice!  Oops, wrong team! lol  This seems too much like a snapshot to me. Maybe a solid background and cropping out the other people this would have worked. I predict there will be a lot of DPCers that will not get this at all!', '2005-10-12 14:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780043, 242427, 19633, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Blown out window is distracting. Would the picture have lost its strength if you had moved in closer and cropped out the street lamp?</td>', 'Interesting subject. Blown out window is distracting. Would the picture have lost its strength if you had moved in closer and cropped out the street lamp?', '2005-10-12 15:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780044, 242192, 43565, '<td valign="top">I do not like the angle (but that is just one person''s opinion).</td>', 'I do not like the angle (but that is just one person''s opinion).', '2005-10-12 15:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780050, 242625, 43565, '<td valign="top">Not sure why "Elvis" is sitting on a car. If it is one of his Cadillacs I think you should have shown more of it, otherwise it would be better without it IMO. Where is his left arm, and why the leis?</td>', 'Not sure why "Elvis" is sitting on a car. If it is one of his Cadillacs I think you should have shown more of it, otherwise it would be better without it IMO. Where is his left arm, and why the leis?', '2005-10-12 15:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780051, 241987, 19633, '<td valign="top">Oh! Two seconds later and the flag would be completely above the people''s head!</td>', 'Oh! Two seconds later and the flag would be completely above the people''s head!', '2005-10-12 15:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780055, 242972, 43761, '<td valign="top">Not just aimed at this particular photo.... Are pieces of cloth on a stick and the armed forces really all Americans have to be proud of?  Seems that almost every expression of national pride from an american here has displayed one or another... lacks imagination imho.  I would have liked to have seen some of the grand and not-so-grand achievements of that great nation and its citizens?<br/></td>', 'Not just aimed at this particular photo.... Are pieces of cloth on a stick and the armed forces really all Americans have to be proud of?  Seems that almost every expression of national pride from an american here has displayed one or another... lacks imagination imho.  I would have liked to have seen some of the grand and not-so-grand achievements of that great nation and its citizens?', '2005-10-12 15:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780064, 243071, 19633, '<td valign="top">I really liked where you were going with this picture. I would have liked to see less washout in the female lions. I also wonder if it wouldn''t have been better with a tighter crop.</td>', 'I really liked where you were going with this picture. I would have liked to see less washout in the female lions. I also wonder if it wouldn''t have been better with a tighter crop.', '2005-10-12 15:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
