(1780582, 242826, 33732, '<td valign="top">Your title is needed to get the message across.  I like the photo.  If the wagon was the concept, less of the cabin would not hurt, close crop.</td>', 'Your title is needed to get the message across.  I like the photo.  If the wagon was the concept, less of the cabin would not hurt, close crop.', '2005-10-12 18:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780583, 243152, 33732, '<td valign="top">I think of protection.  I like the photo.</td>', 'I think of protection.  I like the photo.', '2005-10-12 18:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780585, 242300, 23042, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! The title really makes this appropriate for this challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done! The title really makes this appropriate for this challenge.', '2005-10-12 18:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780588, 242092, 23042, '<td valign="top">Cute! He looks very proud to me.</td>', 'Cute! He looks very proud to me.', '2005-10-12 18:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780592, 242263, 23042, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo for this challenge, but the truck in the background distracts from the overall image.</td>', 'I think this is a great photo for this challenge, but the truck in the background distracts from the overall image.', '2005-10-12 18:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780609, 241994, 42005, '<td valign="top">Everyrthing is great about this! Thanks for sharing.   Enjoy your family.</td>', 'Everyrthing is great about this! Thanks for sharing.   Enjoy your family.', '2005-10-12 18:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780669, 242300, 39349, '<td valign="top">One of the best shots in this challenge. Next to mine ;) but I''m sure this one is doing MUCH better than mine..<br/> <br/>Okay onto what I like about this shot. The selective desaturation really makes this shot for me. I think if you would have not doe so it would be a very "normal" or dare I say "plain" shot. The pine needles make for a very rustic feel to a great shot to ring the the fall season!<br/> <br/>Wonderful job. I give you a 10.</td>', 'One of the best shots in this challenge. Next to mine ;) but I''m sure this one is doing MUCH better than mine.. Okay onto what I like about this shot. The selective desaturation really makes this shot for me. I think if you would have not doe so it would be a very "normal" or dare I say "plain" shot. The pine needles make for a very rustic feel to a great shot to ring the the fall season! Wonderful job. I give you a 10.', '2005-10-12 19:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780703, 241838, 42392, '<td valign="top">great shot 10!!!!</td>', 'great shot 10!!!!', '2005-10-12 19:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780723, 243007, 39349, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you are very proud of this, I know I would be if it were mine! I think this shot would have benefited more from a different angle of the plane. Your sky is blown out on the right side which creates an unbalanced sky. <br/> <br/>I do like the DOF and the detail in the nose of the aircraft. Airplanes are like exotic sports cars, motorcycles, models...etc...etc...they have very sexy lines, show''em off!</td>', 'I''m sure you are very proud of this, I know I would be if it were mine! I think this shot would have benefited more from a different angle of the plane. Your sky is blown out on the right side which creates an unbalanced sky.  I do like the DOF and the detail in the nose of the aircraft. Airplanes are like exotic sports cars, motorcycles, models...etc...etc...they have very sexy lines, show''em off!', '2005-10-12 19:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780725, 242103, 39349, '<td valign="top">Like the detail in the smoke.</td>', 'Like the detail in the smoke.', '2005-10-12 19:40:41.000000', NULL, 1);
