(1780903, 241798, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and lit shot in my opinion. The only thing I would personally change would to have a slightly smaller border. For me, the larger white border detracts and is too close to the large white backgroudn area, but again, very nice interpretation of pride indeed. 8</td>', 'Nicely composed and lit shot in my opinion. The only thing I would personally change would to have a slightly smaller border. For me, the larger white border detracts and is too close to the large white backgroudn area, but again, very nice interpretation of pride indeed. 8', '2005-10-12 21:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
