(1780905, 243091, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like this concept of pride. Nicely setup. The setting sun is a nice touch, especially in the area on the flag. I guess the only thing I would have like to have seen would be a bit more light in the foreground around the boys'' faces.</td>', 'I like this concept of pride. Nicely setup. The setting sun is a nice touch, especially in the area on the flag. I guess the only thing I would have like to have seen would be a bit more light in the foreground around the boys'' faces.', '2005-10-12 21:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
