(1781108, 242508, 38800, '<td valign="top">From what I can see, and maybe I am wrong, but it looks like a bad attempt at dodging around the child, producing a halo-ish effect around his body. It makes the child look like he was cut and pasted onto the picture.</td>', 'From what I can see, and maybe I am wrong, but it looks like a bad attempt at dodging around the child, producing a halo-ish effect around his body. It makes the child look like he was cut and pasted onto the picture.', '2005-10-12 23:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
