(1782639, 241798, 18073, '<td valign="top">this has a nice intimate feel to it but I am not sure about the pose of the dad.  I do like the close crop though.  It may be the conversion whne resized for the web, but it also seems a little soft, particularly on the little one.<br/> <br/>Nice image though, i''d like one like this of me with my daughter!</td>', 'this has a nice intimate feel to it but I am not sure about the pose of the dad.  I do like the close crop though.  It may be the conversion whne resized for the web, but it also seems a little soft, particularly on the little one. Nice image though, i''d like one like this of me with my daughter!', '2005-10-13 19:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782643, 242834, 18073, '<td valign="top">This really made me smile!  That expression is really cute, he really does look pleased with himself LOL.<br/> <br/>Reckon just a touch more contrase might have made this one jump out of the screen a little more, but a real good ''un anyway.  Nice job!</td>', 'This really made me smile!  That expression is really cute, he really does look pleased with himself LOL. Reckon just a touch more contrase might have made this one jump out of the screen a little more, but a real good ''un anyway.  Nice job!', '2005-10-13 19:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782645, 242133, 43116, '<td valign="top">my favorite part about soccer tournaments!</td>', 'my favorite part about soccer tournaments!', '2005-10-13 19:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782651, 242103, 18073, '<td valign="top">Tis a shame, but I think that you needed to get the exposure spot on to make this one work, buts its always tricky when shooting against a bright sky.  I reckon a stop or 2 more would have done the trick.  I say this because the flag I guess is the idea behind the shot, and it seems really under exposed.<br/> <br/>Personally I would also of placed the parachute more into the corner of the frame and hade the smoke leading a diagonal line right out of the frame.  Its a tough shot to get right, better luck next time.</td>', 'Tis a shame, but I think that you needed to get the exposure spot on to make this one work, buts its always tricky when shooting against a bright sky.  I reckon a stop or 2 more would have done the trick.  I say this because the flag I guess is the idea behind the shot, and it seems really under exposed. Personally I would also of placed the parachute more into the corner of the frame and hade the smoke leading a diagonal line right out of the frame.  Its a tough shot to get right, better luck next time.', '2005-10-13 19:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782664, 242432, 45857, '<td valign="top">Adorable little girl, photo is technically impressive and you show a mastery of your craft, but what did she win and how do i know it?<br/> <br/>(perhaps outside the rules, but I might see if I could tweak the color in her eyes)</td>', 'Adorable little girl, photo is technically impressive and you show a mastery of your craft, but what did she win and how do i know it? (perhaps outside the rules, but I might see if I could tweak the color in her eyes)', '2005-10-13 19:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782668, 242684, 45857, '<td valign="top">don''t get it....</td>', 'don''t get it....', '2005-10-13 20:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782671, 242061, 45857, '<td valign="top">a novel approach..</td>', 'a novel approach..', '2005-10-13 20:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782680, 242300, 45632, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot...not too much not too little....I believe it has a nice balance.</td>', 'Very nice shot...not too much not too little....I believe it has a nice balance.', '2005-10-13 20:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782683, 242461, 45857, '<td valign="top">a proud lioness for sure.</td>', 'a proud lioness for sure.', '2005-10-13 20:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
