(1782874, 242263, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I think the composition is good, and the colours are beautiful.  The DOF is just right.  I wish the face had a bit more light on it, and I also wish the object in back were not there, it is a bit distracting.  But it is a beautiful picture, and well suited to "pride".  ~8</td>', 'I like this shot.  I think the composition is good, and the colours are beautiful.  The DOF is just right.  I wish the face had a bit more light on it, and I also wish the object in back were not there, it is a bit distracting.  But it is a beautiful picture, and well suited to "pride".  ~8', '2005-10-13 22:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
