(1783623, 243029, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a cute picture, but it seems out of focus and overexposed.  I''d like to see more texture, light and shadow variance on the boy''s face.  Tack sharp focus is essential for an effective portrait (and any photo for that matter). Maybe work on lighting so it''s not so harsh. Or do it outside with early morning or late evening light. The crop is good and the crab adds a nice "boy" touch to it.</td>', 'This is a cute picture, but it seems out of focus and overexposed.  I''d like to see more texture, light and shadow variance on the boy''s face.  Tack sharp focus is essential for an effective portrait (and any photo for that matter). Maybe work on lighting so it''s not so harsh. Or do it outside with early morning or late evening light. The crop is good and the crab adds a nice "boy" touch to it.', '2005-10-14 09:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783630, 242998, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a snap shot feel to it. I like the clarity, the darling expression and the smooth skin tones, but in order for this to have a truly artful feel, it needs more thoughtful placement.  The crop is tight and I think it would be much more effective if he were standing on a stage at his school, or perhaps outside, with more negative space and good DOF.  Just some suggestions. The subject matter is really appealing - just needs better execution.</td>', 'This has a snap shot feel to it. I like the clarity, the darling expression and the smooth skin tones, but in order for this to have a truly artful feel, it needs more thoughtful placement.  The crop is tight and I think it would be much more effective if he were standing on a stage at his school, or perhaps outside, with more negative space and good DOF.  Just some suggestions. The subject matter is really appealing - just needs better execution.', '2005-10-14 09:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783633, 242508, 15711, '<td valign="top">The colors of this work well together, but the overall shot just looks like a quick snapshot.  It doesn''t have the artistic feel of a true high ranked photograph.  The guy with the blue shirt sitting inside the train is a distraction.  It might be fun to have the boy inside the engine house as if he''s "in charge." to get the sense of the title. The perspective would work better if you were down on his level, so that your "eye" is where his would look.</td>', 'The colors of this work well together, but the overall shot just looks like a quick snapshot.  It doesn''t have the artistic feel of a true high ranked photograph.  The guy with the blue shirt sitting inside the train is a distraction.  It might be fun to have the boy inside the engine house as if he''s "in charge." to get the sense of the title. The perspective would work better if you were down on his level, so that your "eye" is where his would look.', '2005-10-14 09:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783644, 241704, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is an unusual wedding portrait.  They look like they don''t really belong there.The light doesn''t showcase her face at all.  It doesn''t have a very romantic sense, as the couple doesn''t seem "connected" and he''s looking off into the distance.  If it were just him alone, leaning on the post, with that far away look, I think I would like it. The colors seem a bit distracting and busy with the various textures of the column and the shiny metallic gold up by his head. It would make an interresting study by itself without humans in the shot. A high contrast black and white might work better. If he were looking into the camera and she were leaning back into him, it might evoke more sense of solidarity yet not be the typical cheesy wedding shot.</td>', 'This is an unusual wedding portrait.  They look like they don''t really belong there.The light doesn''t showcase her face at all.  It doesn''t have a very romantic sense, as the couple doesn''t seem "connected" and he''s looking off into the distance.  If it were just him alone, leaning on the post, with that far away look, I think I would like it. The colors seem a bit distracting and busy with the various textures of the column and the shiny metallic gold up by his head. It would make an interresting study by itself without humans in the shot. A high contrast black and white might work better. If he were looking into the camera and she were leaning back into him, it might evoke more sense of solidarity yet not be the typical cheesy wedding shot.', '2005-10-14 09:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783648, 243004, 15711, '<td valign="top">The macro is good and thedetail is ok, but it just doesn''t wow me for some reason. The blurred plant being in the foreground is distracting.  Maybe a darker background would have showcased his green body better. As it is, he sort of blends into the greenish yellow.</td>', 'The macro is good and thedetail is ok, but it just doesn''t wow me for some reason. The blurred plant being in the foreground is distracting.  Maybe a darker background would have showcased his green body better. As it is, he sort of blends into the greenish yellow.', '2005-10-14 09:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783652, 241902, 15711, '<td valign="top">The crop is too tight. This would work so much better as a landscape lay out with lost of space around the red building.  The colors could be enriched - maybe it''s the light and time of day.</td>', 'The crop is too tight. This would work so much better as a landscape lay out with lost of space around the red building.  The colors could be enriched - maybe it''s the light and time of day.', '2005-10-14 10:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783655, 241856, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cute little tike, but this has a very snapshot feel to it. The focus is good and the detail of the rocks is well done. I''d like to see light illuminating his face and maybe a tighter zoom on him. Maybe crop out everything to the left of him, including the huge rock and grassy area, and then put it in black and white, upping the contrst. He has that almost "bullseye" feel, being so close to the center of the image.</td>', 'Cute little tike, but this has a very snapshot feel to it. The focus is good and the detail of the rocks is well done. I''d like to see light illuminating his face and maybe a tighter zoom on him. Maybe crop out everything to the left of him, including the huge rock and grassy area, and then put it in black and white, upping the contrst. He has that almost "bullseye" feel, being so close to the center of the image.', '2005-10-14 10:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783659, 242689, 15711, '<td valign="top">THis would be much more effective if he were in tennis wear and on a court with a ball coming at him. As it is, it just looks like he grabbed the raquet for a quick snapshot. He has an almost angry expression. The focus is clear and the DOF is good. Just put it in a different locale (with him wearing different clothing).</td>', 'THis would be much more effective if he were in tennis wear and on a court with a ball coming at him. As it is, it just looks like he grabbed the raquet for a quick snapshot. He has an almost angry expression. The focus is clear and the DOF is good. Just put it in a different locale (with him wearing different clothing).', '2005-10-14 10:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783661, 242240, 21183, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo - very characterful - and I''ve scored it 8.  I like the way the light falls on that rusty chain and the background has a pleasing bokeh. But, I would have scored this higher without the wide border, I think. (Have been relying on too big a border on some of my submissions too and seeing yours helps me understand that it doesn''t always enhance the photo as much as we think, but instead creates too much of a distraction).</td>', 'This is a great photo - very characterful - and I''ve scored it 8.  I like the way the light falls on that rusty chain and the background has a pleasing bokeh. But, I would have scored this higher without the wide border, I think. (Have been relying on too big a border on some of my submissions too and seeing yours helps me understand that it doesn''t always enhance the photo as much as we think, but instead creates too much of a distraction).', '2005-10-14 10:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783668, 242834, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cute kid. The skin tones seem a tad too pink. The crop is too tight and he has that "bulls eye" sense - being dead center in the shot. I think it would be more effective if you saw him full figure, with negative space exagerated on one side of him, as he''s  holding the statues up - one in each hand as if to say "TA DA!!" I''d like to see this adorable boy in a regular portrait, with eyes open, showing a toothy grin.</td>', 'Cute kid. The skin tones seem a tad too pink. The crop is too tight and he has that "bulls eye" sense - being dead center in the shot. I think it would be more effective if you saw him full figure, with negative space exagerated on one side of him, as he''s  holding the statues up - one in each hand as if to say "TA DA!!" I''d like to see this adorable boy in a regular portrait, with eyes open, showing a toothy grin.', '2005-10-14 10:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783671, 242848, 15711, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if this is a wax figure, or a real person.  The light is a bit too harsh.  It would be fun to have darker light and shadow play - to create a more deep and forboding sense of it. His hand is blown out and there is a hot spot down to the right of the stockade that''s distracting.</td>', 'I can''t tell if this is a wax figure, or a real person.  The light is a bit too harsh.  It would be fun to have darker light and shadow play - to create a more deep and forboding sense of it. His hand is blown out and there is a hot spot down to the right of the stockade that''s distracting.', '2005-10-14 10:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783672, 242654, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has an interesting sense to it. The crop seems to tight. Maybe pull out a bit and show more of the pendant. The focus is good and the use of negative space is ok, but I''d like to see a bit more of it.</td>', 'This has an interesting sense to it. The crop seems to tight. Maybe pull out a bit and show more of the pendant. The focus is good and the use of negative space is ok, but I''d like to see a bit more of it.', '2005-10-14 10:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783675, 243088, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d like to just see the hand with a single light source, as if it''s reaching out of the darkness. This is too centered and could use more negative space.  IT''s also not focused like it should be to get any sense of POW from the diamond.</td>', 'I''d like to just see the hand with a single light source, as if it''s reaching out of the darkness. This is too centered and could use more negative space.  IT''s also not focused like it should be to get any sense of POW from the diamond.', '2005-10-14 10:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783676, 242820, 43774, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, I think it is the best in the contest and I have scored it high. I can sort of see the relationship to the theme but others may not, but I wish you well anyway!</td>', 'I love this photo, I think it is the best in the contest and I have scored it high. I can sort of see the relationship to the theme but others may not, but I wish you well anyway!', '2005-10-14 10:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783678, 242240, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting study.  The DOF is good. I think the black of the frame is distracting. Maybe a bit too wide for my taste.  I think I''d crop just above that top lock and leave out that rectangular metal shape at the top. More negative space to the left would have worked a bit better as it has too much of a "centered" sense to it. I think the focus would use a bit of tweaking as well.</td>', 'This is an interesting study.  The DOF is good. I think the black of the frame is distracting. Maybe a bit too wide for my taste.  I think I''d crop just above that top lock and leave out that rectangular metal shape at the top. More negative space to the left would have worked a bit better as it has too much of a "centered" sense to it. I think the focus would use a bit of tweaking as well.', '2005-10-14 10:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783681, 242097, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has noe sense of depth. I''d like to see this card lying by the hold with the pin sticking up - to make it more 3 dimensional.</td>', 'This has noe sense of depth. I''d like to see this card lying by the hold with the pin sticking up - to make it more 3 dimensional.', '2005-10-14 10:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783684, 242092, 21183, '<td valign="top">Really like this photo a great deal.  Have voted it with a 9, but think there are some things which might have eliicited a 10 (from me, anyway). Am thinking that it would look better with some crop off the bottom and a tad less crop off the top so that the boy''s head sits just a bit lower down in the frame. Love the look in the little chap''s eyes and his stance as he holds up the apple.  Nice. Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Really like this photo a great deal.  Have voted it with a 9, but think there are some things which might have eliicited a 10 (from me, anyway). Am thinking that it would look better with some crop off the bottom and a tad less crop off the top so that the boy''s head sits just a bit lower down in the frame. Love the look in the little chap''s eyes and his stance as he holds up the apple.  Nice. Best of luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-14 10:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783686, 242544, 15711, '<td valign="top">The negative space is good. The placement of the shoes is as if you just took them off, threw the ribbon on the ground and went to grab a Gator Aid. The lighting off of the medal is a bit harsh. I think the yellow of the frame, although it ties into the other coloration, is a bit too much. Maybe a creamy off white like the stripe of the shoe would have worked better.  The focus doesn''t seem quite as tack sharp as I''d like to see. 6</td>', 'The negative space is good. The placement of the shoes is as if you just took them off, threw the ribbon on the ground and went to grab a Gator Aid. The lighting off of the medal is a bit harsh. I think the yellow of the frame, although it ties into the other coloration, is a bit too much. Maybe a creamy off white like the stripe of the shoe would have worked better.  The focus doesn''t seem quite as tack sharp as I''d like to see. 6', '2005-10-14 10:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783687, 242263, 15711, '<td valign="top">The crop is too tight.  I''d like to see better lighting and a glint in his eye.</td>', 'The crop is too tight.  I''d like to see better lighting and a glint in his eye.', '2005-10-14 10:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783689, 242832, 15711, '<td valign="top">Her skin tones are a bit too yellow. I''d like to see her with more negative space to the left. The focus isn''t tack sharp either. I''d like a crop just below the best, with a closer view of her face.  The lipstick is too harsh for the shot. I do like the windows and column as the setting. They add a nice architectural sense to it.</td>', 'Her skin tones are a bit too yellow. I''d like to see her with more negative space to the left. The focus isn''t tack sharp either. I''d like a crop just below the best, with a closer view of her face.  The lipstick is too harsh for the shot. I do like the windows and column as the setting. They add a nice architectural sense to it.', '2005-10-14 10:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783691, 240709, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE.  I like the glint in the eye, but the focus isn''t tack sharp.  I''d crop out the blanket. The pillow behind the head with the design on it is a tad distracting. I''d show the entire bucket too seeing as that''s the focus of the title.</td>', 'HEE HEE.  I like the glint in the eye, but the focus isn''t tack sharp.  I''d crop out the blanket. The pillow behind the head with the design on it is a tad distracting. I''d show the entire bucket too seeing as that''s the focus of the title.', '2005-10-14 10:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783695, 241242, 15711, '<td valign="top">He has a nice pleasant expression. I''d crop just below his shoulders and make it more of a true portrait, with more concentration on his face. I''d have more negative space to the left of the shot if left in this pose, or do a tight close up and have him fill up the entire shot.  THE DOF is good but thebackground  lighting is a tad harsh. Maybe tone down the white area behind him. The lighting on his face is nicely done. I''d have him take off the sunglasses too - they detract from his handsome face.</td>', 'He has a nice pleasant expression. I''d crop just below his shoulders and make it more of a true portrait, with more concentration on his face. I''d have more negative space to the left of the shot if left in this pose, or do a tight close up and have him fill up the entire shot.  THE DOF is good but thebackground  lighting is a tad harsh. Maybe tone down the white area behind him. The lighting on his face is nicely done. I''d have him take off the sunglasses too - they detract from his handsome face.', '2005-10-14 10:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783697, 241881, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - that guy is having fun. He must be a judge of some kind? The overall shot has a snap shot sense to it. It''s not tack sharp either, which hurts it. Considering the setting, there is going to be lots going on behind him, but if the background were blurred more, it would make him more the center of attention.</td>', 'HEE HEE - that guy is having fun. He must be a judge of some kind? The overall shot has a snap shot sense to it. It''s not tack sharp either, which hurts it. Considering the setting, there is going to be lots going on behind him, but if the background were blurred more, it would make him more the center of attention.', '2005-10-14 10:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783698, 242499, 21183, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, which I think deserves to do really well, but wonder if it does such a good job of conveying pride? I''m voting it a 7.  I''m so so wishing that I could see it saying "pride" to me (of course that must be my fault?), but if it DID convey "pride" to me then I would have given it 8/9 (or a 10 without the twigs in the top left).</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, which I think deserves to do really well, but wonder if it does such a good job of conveying pride? I''m voting it a 7.  I''m so so wishing that I could see it saying "pride" to me (of course that must be my fault?), but if it DID convey "pride" to me then I would have given it 8/9 (or a 10 without the twigs in the top left).', '2005-10-14 10:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783709, 243019, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is interesting but her face is out of focass. I like that her outfit and the rug on the wall match.</td>', 'This is interesting but her face is out of focass. I like that her outfit and the rug on the wall match.', '2005-10-14 10:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783712, 242225, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t see anything prideful about his face.  The DOF is good and the focus is ok, but it just doesn''t have any punch for me somehow. Maybe if I could see more of his face. As it is, the shadow kind of hides too much of it for me.</td>', 'I don''t see anything prideful about his face.  The DOF is good and the focus is ok, but it just doesn''t have any punch for me somehow. Maybe if I could see more of his face. As it is, the shadow kind of hides too much of it for me.', '2005-10-14 10:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783720, 242694, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is way to overexposed with the late day light bathing the entire shot in yellow light.  The subject is fine and the pumpkins in the background is ok, but for it to work, he needs to have tack sharp focus and maybe have the pumpkins blurred, to create an interesting DOF. His placement in the shot is good but that light just kills it for me.</td>', 'This is way to overexposed with the late day light bathing the entire shot in yellow light.  The subject is fine and the pumpkins in the background is ok, but for it to work, he needs to have tack sharp focus and maybe have the pumpkins blurred, to create an interesting DOF. His placement in the shot is good but that light just kills it for me.', '2005-10-14 10:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783724, 241155, 21183, '<td valign="top">I voted 4.  Am thinking that the photo needs more light in the foreground to make it more appealing and create greater contrasts. At the moment it looks quite flat. Trying hard to see how the photo conveys "pride" - it seems hidden from me - yet you might see its meaning, emotionally, to yourself.</td>', 'I voted 4.  Am thinking that the photo needs more light in the foreground to make it more appealing and create greater contrasts. At the moment it looks quite flat. Trying hard to see how the photo conveys "pride" - it seems hidden from me - yet you might see its meaning, emotionally, to yourself.', '2005-10-14 10:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783728, 241338, 45978, '<td valign="top">Unlike the others this picture shows three types of pride, pride of what has been created and cannot yet be seen, pride and love for the vessel and pride of own creation. Lighting eminates levels of pride maybe, very clever!</td>', 'Unlike the others this picture shows three types of pride, pride of what has been created and cannot yet be seen, pride and love for the vessel and pride of own creation. Lighting eminates levels of pride maybe, very clever!', '2005-10-14 10:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783729, 241637, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is sweet, but has more of a snapshot sense to it.  The subjects need to be tack sharp for this to work well. There isn''t alot of contrast.  Id maybe shoot from a different angle. The arms  in the foreground are a bit distracting as well. Also, utilize your maximum 640 pixelation, for a larger image.</td>', 'This is sweet, but has more of a snapshot sense to it.  The subjects need to be tack sharp for this to work well. There isn''t alot of contrast.  Id maybe shoot from a different angle. The arms  in the foreground are a bit distracting as well. Also, utilize your maximum 640 pixelation, for a larger image.', '2005-10-14 10:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783732, 241908, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has just a snapshot sense to it. For this to work effectively, I think it needs a more artful presentation. I like the black and white. The stacked chairs behind the girl''s head are distracting. Maybe just have her sitting by the mom, or in her lap, gazing up at her - it might evoke more emotion and look more artistic.</td>', 'This has just a snapshot sense to it. For this to work effectively, I think it needs a more artful presentation. I like the black and white. The stacked chairs behind the girl''s head are distracting. Maybe just have her sitting by the mom, or in her lap, gazing up at her - it might evoke more emotion and look more artistic.', '2005-10-14 10:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783737, 242895, 15711, '<td valign="top">Um.. blurred and ... what is it???? Nothing about this photo evokes an emotion, you don''t know what it is, the writing is illegible.</td>', 'Um.. blurred and ... what is it???? Nothing about this photo evokes an emotion, you don''t know what it is, the writing is illegible.', '2005-10-14 10:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783741, 243043, 15711, '<td valign="top">I get the rainbow and the pride thing, but I''d much rather see a Gay March that this doll.  The focus is fine and the lighting is even good but what''s with the doll?????</td>', 'I get the rainbow and the pride thing, but I''d much rather see a Gay March that this doll.  The focus is fine and the lighting is even good but what''s with the doll?????', '2005-10-14 10:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783742, 243191, 15711, '<td valign="top">Too small. The focus is way off. There is a grainy texture and the border doesn''t add to the shot at all.</td>', 'Too small. The focus is way off. There is a grainy texture and the border doesn''t add to the shot at all.', '2005-10-14 10:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783744, 241357, 15711, '<td valign="top">Um.. survivor of what? I can''t hardly tell what it is.  It''s blurred and there is nothing to focus on.</td>', 'Um.. survivor of what? I can''t hardly tell what it is.  It''s blurred and there is nothing to focus on.', '2005-10-14 10:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783747, 242625, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL.  Not a great photo, but funny nonetheless. Way over exposed and the car doesn''t add to the shot.  The evergreen in the background is distracting as well.</td>', 'ROFL.  Not a great photo, but funny nonetheless. Way over exposed and the car doesn''t add to the shot.  The evergreen in the background is distracting as well.', '2005-10-14 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
