(1783813, 243154, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of a man and his dog, but I''m not sure what I am looking at in the background which I assume is supposed to be another thing he is proud about, but I am at a loss to identify what it is.</td>', 'I like the idea of a man and his dog, but I''m not sure what I am looking at in the background which I assume is supposed to be another thing he is proud about, but I am at a loss to identify what it is.', '2005-10-14 11:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
