(1783822, 242617, 43031, '<td valign="top">loved the expression and the contrast here. usually big reflections from windows don''t work in pictures, especially when the shooter is in the reflections :o), however I think after looking at this more than a few times, it seems that the reflection actually served to frame the girl. i like it, gave it a 7.</td>', 'loved the expression and the contrast here. usually big reflections from windows don''t work in pictures, especially when the shooter is in the reflections :o), however I think after looking at this more than a few times, it seems that the reflection actually served to frame the girl. i like it, gave it a 7.', '2005-10-14 11:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783827, 242890, 43031, '<td valign="top">good lighting, great pose and expression on her is great. tad oversharpened, especially shows on her hair.</td>', 'good lighting, great pose and expression on her is great. tad oversharpened, especially shows on her hair.', '2005-10-14 11:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
