(1783841, 242820, 42995, '<td valign="top">i think this is an absolutely wonderful photo, great textures and expression.  i must confess i am having a hard time tying it to ''pride'' though.</td>', 'i think this is an absolutely wonderful photo, great textures and expression.  i must confess i am having a hard time tying it to ''pride'' though.', '2005-10-14 11:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783842, 242501, 42995, '<td valign="top">funny, cute, cheery -- if she had been clapping it would have been even more appropriate.  nicely done.</td>', 'funny, cute, cheery -- if she had been clapping it would have been even more appropriate.  nicely done.', '2005-10-14 11:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783845, 241908, 42995, '<td valign="top">this is a nice photo.  i think that the girl''s expression clearly demonstrates pride, but the stacked chairs behind her detract from the image somewhat.</td>', 'this is a nice photo.  i think that the girl''s expression clearly demonstrates pride, but the stacked chairs behind her detract from the image somewhat.', '2005-10-14 11:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783849, 241903, 42995, '<td valign="top">wonderful allotment garden shot!  the strength of the solitary sunflower might have been increased if she were photographed either from closer to the ground or without the trees behind her.  still, very nice.</td>', 'wonderful allotment garden shot!  the strength of the solitary sunflower might have been increased if she were photographed either from closer to the ground or without the trees behind her.  still, very nice.', '2005-10-14 11:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783853, 242527, 43031, '<td valign="top">mostly good pose and composition. looked a little too grainy, and needs some more contrast IMO. The spot on the cusp of the shoulder going towards the armpit looks weird for some reason.</td>', 'mostly good pose and composition. looked a little too grainy, and needs some more contrast IMO. The spot on the cusp of the shoulder going towards the armpit looks weird for some reason.', '2005-10-14 11:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783854, 242267, 42995, '<td valign="top">nice photo.  wish that the lighting on her face were a bit more even; her cheeks and chin seem a bit dark.  good focus.</td>', 'nice photo.  wish that the lighting on her face were a bit more even; her cheeks and chin seem a bit dark.  good focus.', '2005-10-14 11:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783855, 242832, 43031, '<td valign="top">the picture is okay as a portrait i guess, but she doesn''t look proud or even happy to be there.</td>', 'the picture is okay as a portrait i guess, but she doesn''t look proud or even happy to be there.', '2005-10-14 11:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783866, 241324, 43031, '<td valign="top">Thee composition of this is pretty good. would have been great if you could have gotten on the field, or gone to a practice and had them pose, you on the ground looking up to increase the sense of height. all of the cheerleaders ar fuzzy though, seems like the camera focused on the background? or maybe this was an extreme crop? digital zoom? also there is a dark halo around them that makes thngs look slightly off. hope this was helpful, keep trying.</td>', 'Thee composition of this is pretty good. would have been great if you could have gotten on the field, or gone to a practice and had them pose, you on the ground looking up to increase the sense of height. all of the cheerleaders ar fuzzy though, seems like the camera focused on the background? or maybe this was an extreme crop? digital zoom? also there is a dark halo around them that makes thngs look slightly off. hope this was helpful, keep trying.', '2005-10-14 11:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783868, 241440, 43031, '<td valign="top">have no idea what this has to do with pride, and the title gives no clues. the grain and tone seem a little affected if you did them on pupose. more creepy than prideful.</td>', 'have no idea what this has to do with pride, and the title gives no clues. the grain and tone seem a little affected if you did them on pupose. more creepy than prideful.', '2005-10-14 11:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783870, 241704, 43031, '<td valign="top">okay, been trying to work out what bothers me. the composition is great. the poses are great, the expressions work for prideful intentional separation (anger, argument..) But none of those work with the wedding attire. This should be a happy occasion and these two look upset.</td>', 'okay, been trying to work out what bothers me. the composition is great. the poses are great, the expressions work for prideful intentional separation (anger, argument..) But none of those work with the wedding attire. This should be a happy occasion and these two look upset.', '2005-10-14 11:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783878, 242582, 43031, '<td valign="top">the blue ribbon is MINE I tell you!! muahahahahaha!<br/> <br/> hehe, sorry. nice picture. wish this were in the member challenge so you could have selectively sharpened the eye more. could have used a little more DOF to catch the eyelash detail. and not to be picky, but there''s either makeup dust in the upper right, or those are blackheads. I like the mole :o). 6 overall</td>', 'the blue ribbon is MINE I tell you!! muahahahahaha!  hehe, sorry. nice picture. wish this were in the member challenge so you could have selectively sharpened the eye more. could have used a little more DOF to catch the eyelash detail. and not to be picky, but there''s either makeup dust in the upper right, or those are blackheads. I like the mole :o). 6 overall', '2005-10-14 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783884, 242656, 43031, '<td valign="top">the high contrast and grunge/grain seem a little too affected, losing some highlights on her stomach, and half her head disappears into the background. the hair seems only a problem as this is a model shot, instead of a candid. she DEOS look very proud though, good job with that. 6</td>', 'the high contrast and grunge/grain seem a little too affected, losing some highlights on her stomach, and half her head disappears into the background. the hair seems only a problem as this is a model shot, instead of a candid. she DEOS look very proud though, good job with that. 6', '2005-10-14 11:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783894, 240782, 42995, '<td valign="top">nice choice of colours, composition.  well done!</td>', 'nice choice of colours, composition.  well done!', '2005-10-14 11:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
