(1783906, 241987, 32997, '<td valign="top">Timing excellent on this..much more meaningful than just a flag..I can sense the pride..and this from a Canadian!</td>', 'Timing excellent on this..much more meaningful than just a flag..I can sense the pride..and this from a Canadian!', '2005-10-14 12:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783950, 241440, 42995, '<td valign="top">i''m hoping that the ''pride'' element of this shot is the fact that the guy is on day five of, what? not smoking?  detox?  chemo? because it''s hard to judge from the photo.  obviously, this photo has meaning to you, but some context is needed to help others get your message.  good luck.</td>', 'i''m hoping that the ''pride'' element of this shot is the fact that the guy is on day five of, what? not smoking?  detox?  chemo? because it''s hard to judge from the photo.  obviously, this photo has meaning to you, but some context is needed to help others get your message.  good luck.', '2005-10-14 12:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783961, 242844, 42995, '<td valign="top">i can''t tell from your caption if "pride" means pride or if "pride" actually means NOT pride, since you put the word in quotes.  kind of like when people call me "shorty" (i''m 6''5").  in any case, more context would have helped this shot; beyond the name, what characteristics of Canon products are you proud of?  their ruggedness? qualily? optics?  i think that a shot that demonstrated one of these qualities might have done better.  good luck in the challenge...</td>', 'i can''t tell from your caption if "pride" means pride or if "pride" actually means NOT pride, since you put the word in quotes.  kind of like when people call me "shorty" (i''m 6''5").  in any case, more context would have helped this shot; beyond the name, what characteristics of Canon products are you proud of?  their ruggedness? qualily? optics?  i think that a shot that demonstrated one of these qualities might have done better.  good luck in the challenge...', '2005-10-14 12:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783965, 242834, 42995, '<td valign="top">this is a cute photo.  nice capture of his face.  the child is obviously proud of his accomplishments, but the backdrop and his shirtlessness detracts from the image, in my opinion.  maybe would have liked to see him on the field, all muddy.</td>', 'this is a cute photo.  nice capture of his face.  the child is obviously proud of his accomplishments, but the backdrop and his shirtlessness detracts from the image, in my opinion.  maybe would have liked to see him on the field, all muddy.', '2005-10-14 12:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783969, 242656, 42995, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice model shot, like the textures in her heans and the jacket.  i''m not sure i can see anything in her pose to suggest pride, however.  still, nicely done.</td>', 'this is a very nice model shot, like the textures in her heans and the jacket.  i''m not sure i can see anything in her pose to suggest pride, however.  still, nicely done.', '2005-10-14 12:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
