(1783975, 243113, 42995, '<td valign="top">a nice photo, only wish the eyes were more in focus.  it seems that you''ve had to crop this shot substantially and the grain might be a bit too obvious.  a good attempt.</td>', 'a nice photo, only wish the eyes were more in focus.  it seems that you''ve had to crop this shot substantially and the grain might be a bit too obvious.  a good attempt.', '2005-10-14 12:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
