(1785695, 241338, 46037, '<td valign="top">This photo held my attention for a long time! There is just something inspiring about it. The lighting, on first apprearance, looks not quite perfect, however, the more I look, it seems to complement all the more. Well done! It''s great!</td>', 'This photo held my attention for a long time! There is just something inspiring about it. The lighting, on first apprearance, looks not quite perfect, however, the more I look, it seems to complement all the more. Well done! It''s great!', '2005-10-15 11:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
