(1785723, 242707, 45784, '<td valign="top">I may be (probably) wrong, but I think I saw this foto somewhere.<br/>Or very similar one, I won''t say for sure. It is lovely!<br/>Great background bluring, very good lighting, colors fit just fine.<br/>If this one is yours (and I''m wrong) congratulations man!</td>', 'I may be (probably) wrong, but I think I saw this foto somewhere.Or very similar one, I won''t say for sure. It is lovely!Great background bluring, very good lighting, colors fit just fine.If this one is yours (and I''m wrong) congratulations man!', '2005-10-15 11:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785734, 241937, 39429, '<td valign="top">While there are technical issues with this image, you have caught such a moment of power and emotion.  I love the wild eye look of the back horse.  After the competition, I hope you are able to clone out the distracting wires and pole.  It''s a wonderful capture.  7</td>', 'While there are technical issues with this image, you have caught such a moment of power and emotion.  I love the wild eye look of the back horse.  After the competition, I hope you are able to clone out the distracting wires and pole.  It''s a wonderful capture.  7', '2005-10-15 11:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785749, 242263, 39429, '<td valign="top">I love the symbolism of this photo.  The symbolism could be so much stronger with more of the roach and feathers showing.  Cutting out the eagle feathers on the left and top left me disappointed.  I do like blurred background, expression and choice of subject.  You''ve been able to catch the detail of the beadwork and each individual hair of the roach.  The focus and DOF are superb. 7</td>', 'I love the symbolism of this photo.  The symbolism could be so much stronger with more of the roach and feathers showing.  Cutting out the eagle feathers on the left and top left me disappointed.  I do like blurred background, expression and choice of subject.  You''ve been able to catch the detail of the beadwork and each individual hair of the roach.  The focus and DOF are superb. 7', '2005-10-15 11:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785818, 241008, 32997, '<td valign="top">Effective..theme comes through clearly..well done</td>', 'Effective..theme comes through clearly..well done', '2005-10-15 12:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785824, 242689, 32997, '<td valign="top">Nice angle..the problem for me is having this shot in a romm as opposed to on the courts..I appreciate this is a choice, but it pulls the whole shot out of the context you intended in my eye, and gives it a strange pretense..ie; I am good as long as I don''t really play..sorry if I sound too picky, certainly your chosen angle has a nice sense of power, as does the look in the eyes..</td>', 'Nice angle..the problem for me is having this shot in a romm as opposed to on the courts..I appreciate this is a choice, but it pulls the whole shot out of the context you intended in my eye, and gives it a strange pretense..ie; I am good as long as I don''t really play..sorry if I sound too picky, certainly your chosen angle has a nice sense of power, as does the look in the eyes..', '2005-10-15 12:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785829, 241440, 32997, '<td valign="top">Bizarre take on theme..eyes are intense, overblown look adds craziness as does grainy look..background doesn''t add to shot for me..without the theme or challenge all I would say is this is a shot of a person suffering..</td>', 'Bizarre take on theme..eyes are intense, overblown look adds craziness as does grainy look..background doesn''t add to shot for me..without the theme or challenge all I would say is this is a shot of a person suffering..', '2005-10-15 12:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785998, 241155, 44860, '<td valign="top">Nice title, ordinary picture. Sorry...</td>', 'Nice title, ordinary picture. Sorry...', '2005-10-15 14:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786001, 242895, 44860, '<td valign="top">Looks like unintentional shot...</td>', 'Looks like unintentional shot...', '2005-10-15 14:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
