(1786038, 242832, 44860, '<td valign="top">Impressive... shadows :)</td>', 'Impressive... shadows :)', '2005-10-15 15:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786044, 241838, 44860, '<td valign="top">Very emotive. I wouldn''t paint country flag on back of my barn, but the world is beautiful of people doing something similiar in different way! I believe this guy is really proud to be American.</td>', 'Very emotive. I wouldn''t paint country flag on back of my barn, but the world is beautiful of people doing something similiar in different way! I believe this guy is really proud to be American.', '2005-10-15 15:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786054, 243043, 44860, '<td valign="top">Hey, you are obsessed with that doll! Go outside, look around - world is full of stunning things! (Please ignore this message if this is your first submission with this toy :) I already saw 2 or 3 of them in previous challenges.</td>', 'Hey, you are obsessed with that doll! Go outside, look around - world is full of stunning things! (Please ignore this message if this is your first submission with this toy :) I already saw 2 or 3 of them in previous challenges.', '2005-10-15 15:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786082, 242875, 43662, '<td valign="top">hippie!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!   10!</td>', 'hippie!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!   10!', '2005-10-15 15:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786100, 240709, 31443, '<td valign="top">Aww what a cutie! Nice work in b/w</td>', 'Aww what a cutie! Nice work in b/w', '2005-10-15 16:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786138, 243029, 43434, '<td valign="top">One of the better portrait type shots i have seen.</td>', 'One of the better portrait type shots i have seen.', '2005-10-15 17:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786143, 242707, 43434, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, the lines accross the eyes seems to detract from it though.</td>', 'Nice picture, the lines accross the eyes seems to detract from it though.', '2005-10-15 17:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786159, 243113, 45857, '<td valign="top">Remarkable image, you''ve captured an expression of fierce resolve.<br/>2nd look- its a shame you can''t reuse this for reflection challenge, would be winner there too. I have a hard time with national pride concept, for me it evokes more the idea of patriotic. That said, your image is just too good ....its still a 10</td>', 'Remarkable image, you''ve captured an expression of fierce resolve.2nd look- its a shame you can''t reuse this for reflection challenge, would be winner there too. I have a hard time with national pride concept, for me it evokes more the idea of patriotic. That said, your image is just too good ....its still a 10', '2005-10-15 17:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786163, 241324, 43434, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but seems to be not quite sharp enough.  Not that it would be easy with so many moving bodies.</td>', 'Nice picture, but seems to be not quite sharp enough.  Not that it would be easy with so many moving bodies.', '2005-10-15 17:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786168, 243114, 43434, '<td valign="top">love the still life perspective. 6.</td>', 'love the still life perspective. 6.', '2005-10-15 17:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786169, 241838, 45857, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time equating patriotic images with pride, must be a 60''s flashback thing. However this image is well planned and well done. Maybe the WB might be a little too warm. The dark&gt;light mountains make the shot for me.  10.</td>', 'I have a hard time equating patriotic images with pride, must be a 60''s flashback thing. However this image is well planned and well done. Maybe the WB might be a little too warm. The dark>light mountains make the shot for me.  10.', '2005-10-15 17:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786195, 243019, 45857, '<td valign="top">This image is really fascinating on so many levels. The woman''s expression transcends pride. Is noble better? Just wonder how she ever got leashed in the first place. Too warm, overexposed, de-sated, who cares.  Kicked it up a notch... 10</td>', 'This image is really fascinating on so many levels. The woman''s expression transcends pride. Is noble better? Just wonder how she ever got leashed in the first place. Too warm, overexposed, de-sated, who cares.  Kicked it up a notch... 10', '2005-10-15 18:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786196, 241324, 41337, '<td valign="top">Needs to be sharper and the top cheerleader looks odd with that unnatural looking shadow.</td>', 'Needs to be sharper and the top cheerleader looks odd with that unnatural looking shadow.', '2005-10-15 18:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786199, 242743, 31443, '<td valign="top">New Zealand? Australia? Where do we have early summer? Lovely image..</td>', 'New Zealand? Australia? Where do we have early summer? Lovely image..', '2005-10-15 18:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786208, 242625, 41337, '<td valign="top">Besides the problem with the highlights the image as a whole looks too blurred/soften for my tastes.</td>', 'Besides the problem with the highlights the image as a whole looks too blurred/soften for my tastes.', '2005-10-15 18:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786212, 241338, 45857, '<td valign="top">So many people had trouble parental pride,  here you perfectly capture it prenatally. The only fault is the unfortunate spot at the top ( though fortunate for her). Could have cropped a little tighter.  9+</td>', 'So many people had trouble parental pride,  here you perfectly capture it prenatally. The only fault is the unfortunate spot at the top ( though fortunate for her). Could have cropped a little tighter.  9+', '2005-10-15 18:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786214, 241398, 41337, '<td valign="top">The image looks too bland. Could use some more contrast and perhaps a saturation boost. Might also work better as a b/w image.</td>', 'The image looks too bland. Could use some more contrast and perhaps a saturation boost. Might also work better as a b/w image.', '2005-10-15 18:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786215, 242267, 31443, '<td valign="top">Wish you had matched the hairbands with those precious eyes! Nice capture and light..</td>', 'Wish you had matched the hairbands with those precious eyes! Nice capture and light..', '2005-10-15 18:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
