(1788779, 241838, 22046, '<td valign="top">I could see this in a magazine to illustrate an artical on the heartland of America. The lighting really makes this special.</td>', 'I could see this in a magazine to illustrate an artical on the heartland of America. The lighting really makes this special.', '2005-10-16 23:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
