(1789445, 241818, 39880, '<td valign="top">An all around great shot.  I like the night shot with star effect on the lights.   Well done.</td>', 'An all around great shot.  I like the night shot with star effect on the lights.   Well done.', '2005-10-17 04:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
