(1789518, 242689, 46117, '<td valign="top">Extremely full of pride, great job!</td>', 'Extremely full of pride, great job!', '2005-10-17 06:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789521, 242432, 44963, '<td valign="top">This is a really impressive image.  Looking at it in thumb-nail I thought, oh-yeh, another kid-shot.  However, when it came up in full I was really impressed.  The movement, the colour and focus all work to provide a vivid image that captures pride very well.  Thanks</td>', 'This is a really impressive image.  Looking at it in thumb-nail I thought, oh-yeh, another kid-shot.  However, when it came up in full I was really impressed.  The movement, the colour and focus all work to provide a vivid image that captures pride very well.  Thanks', '2005-10-17 06:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789525, 241324, 44963, '<td valign="top">Great subject, perfect opportunity to produce an image showing pride.  I would have liked to see a little more focus (clarity) in the shot.  I know it is very difficult under the lighting you had - and hey I rarely get it right.  It would, in this case, have made the difference to me.</td>', 'Great subject, perfect opportunity to produce an image showing pride.  I would have liked to see a little more focus (clarity) in the shot.  I know it is very difficult under the lighting you had - and hey I rarely get it right.  It would, in this case, have made the difference to me.', '2005-10-17 06:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789532, 243091, 44963, '<td valign="top">This shot impressed me.  The lighting, the focus of the kids on the flag and the fact that the flag is a small version of something that is awefully big.  The camera work was good but I liked the compostion and the story it offers even better.</td>', 'This shot impressed me.  The lighting, the focus of the kids on the flag and the fact that the flag is a small version of something that is awefully big.  The camera work was good but I liked the compostion and the story it offers even better.', '2005-10-17 06:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
