(1789547, 243007, 44963, '<td valign="top">The content of this image attracted my attention immediately - What a beautiful piece of aircraft.  I would certainly be proud if I owned it - or could even fly it.  From the photo side of it there is a bit of clutter in the background that distracts from the sleek lines of the aircraft.  I know the perspective you took is the best for impact but in this case I might have gone around the the right just a little.  Great shot, I envy the pilot.</td>', 'The content of this image attracted my attention immediately - What a beautiful piece of aircraft.  I would certainly be proud if I owned it - or could even fly it.  From the photo side of it there is a bit of clutter in the background that distracts from the sleek lines of the aircraft.  I know the perspective you took is the best for impact but in this case I might have gone around the the right just a little.  Great shot, I envy the pilot.', '2005-10-17 06:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789551, 242860, 43643, '<td valign="top">??</td>', '??', '2005-10-17 06:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
