(1789558, 242853, 44963, '<td valign="top">This is a great bit of photography - movement, focus, lighting - all work pretty well for me.  However, not being of U.S. the pride bit missed me in the traslation.  I don''t understand the historic/cultural significance.  Interpretation is a big bit of some of these challenges.  Thanks for the image though - it certainly held my eye.</td>', 'This is a great bit of photography - movement, focus, lighting - all work pretty well for me.  However, not being of U.S. the pride bit missed me in the traslation.  I don''t understand the historic/cultural significance.  Interpretation is a big bit of some of these challenges.  Thanks for the image though - it certainly held my eye.', '2005-10-17 07:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
