(1794644, 242432, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hell, people, I even entered "what?" instead of "reflections" just to spare y''all "yet another spectacular sky reflected in the marsh" shot... Sometimes I wonder if people have ever really LOOKED at my full range of challenge entries. It''s just that my BEST pictures are almost always scenics, ''cuz that''s what I do, ya know? Those are the ones that sell, too.<br/> <br/>Anyway, thanks for the kind words. To those who question whether this depicts "pride", all I can say is that when I saw this shot (from the clambake, not shot for the challenge at all) I said to myself "Damn, she looks proud of herself!" so I entered it. And, for those who asked, she''d just won an impromptu race to the water and back the kids had organized up.</td>', 'Hell, people, I even entered "what?" instead of "reflections" just to spare y''all "yet another spectacular sky reflected in the marsh" shot... Sometimes I wonder if people have ever really LOOKED at my full range of challenge entries. It''s just that my BEST pictures are almost always scenics, ''cuz that''s what I do, ya know? Those are the ones that sell, too. Anyway, thanks for the kind words. To those who question whether this depicts "pride", all I can say is that when I saw this shot (from the clambake, not shot for the challenge at all) I said to myself "Damn, she looks proud of herself!" so I entered it. And, for those who asked, she''d just won an impromptu race to the water and back the kids had organized up.', '2005-10-19 03:31:10.000000', NULL, 0),
