(1795710, 242432, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top ten finish with this beautiful picture!  I''ve been reading (and reacting to) the thread about the Pride top 10, and I wanted to say that this picture very much does say "Pride" to me, and the title emphasizes it.  I''ve seen that same expression in my kids'' faces when they are proud of something or another.  It''s like, "I did it!  YES!!!!".<br/> <br/>Anyway.  Congratulations again.  Your pictures are beautiful to look at.<br/> <br/>Looking at this picture again.  You know what I really like about it?  The tones.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-20 13:08:29.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on your top ten finish with this beautiful picture!  I''ve been reading (and reacting to) the thread about the Pride top 10, and I wanted to say that this picture very much does say "Pride" to me, and the title emphasizes it.  I''ve seen that same expression in my kids'' faces when they are proud of something or another.  It''s like, "I did it!  YES!!!!". Anyway.  Congratulations again.  Your pictures are beautiful to look at. Looking at this picture again.  You know what I really like about it?  The tones.', '2005-10-19 14:27:03.000000', '2005-10-20 14:08:29.000000', 0),
(1795862, 241700, 38223, '<td valign="top">I''m loving it!</td>', 'I''m loving it!', '2005-10-19 15:34:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1795967, 241893, 6349, '<td valign="top">this should be the blue ribbon and you should be a model</td>', 'this should be the blue ribbon and you should be a model', '2005-10-19 16:25:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1796008, 242617, 14620, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Great B&amp;W!</td>', 'I love this.  Great B&W!', '2005-10-19 16:44:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1796100, 242652, 24613, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  I wish more people had the attitude that "stam" has, but in this politically correct world, it''s getting more and more like a bad thing to love your country.  Screw ''em - God bless the USA! :)</td>', 'Excellent shot!  I wish more people had the attitude that "stam" has, but in this politically correct world, it''s getting more and more like a bad thing to love your country.  Screw ''em - God bless the USA! :)', '2005-10-19 17:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1796205, 241893, 39270, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome picture in relationship to the challenge topic, execution of the photo and finally my personal favorite.  When I see this picture I see someone creating art years beyond there age.  I don''t mean to say that young people are not capable of high artistic abilities (dpc youth obviously prove that theory wrong), but your execution speaks of experience beyond possible years.  In other words you are a wonderfully talented and quick learner in this craft.  Oh and what JPR said you should be a model.</td>', 'This is an awesome picture in relationship to the challenge topic, execution of the photo and finally my personal favorite.  When I see this picture I see someone creating art years beyond there age.  I don''t mean to say that young people are not capable of high artistic abilities (dpc youth obviously prove that theory wrong), but your execution speaks of experience beyond possible years.  In other words you are a wonderfully talented and quick learner in this craft.  Oh and what JPR said you should be a model.', '2005-10-19 17:57:10.000000', NULL, 0),
