(1801803, 242895, 7151, '<td valign="top">Two more tens.  If you keep this up, you''ll develop a cult following.  Every time they see an out-of-focus picture, they''ll immediately think "Ah, another piece by Sonej!" and score it a 10.  Of course, beware of the copy-cat artists - they''ll try to impersonate you.<br/> <br/>BTW, what is "catesse"?</td>', 'Two more tens.  If you keep this up, you''ll develop a cult following.  Every time they see an out-of-focus picture, they''ll immediately think "Ah, another piece by Sonej!" and score it a 10.  Of course, beware of the copy-cat artists - they''ll try to impersonate you. BTW, what is "catesse"?', '2005-10-21 19:08:54.000000', NULL, 0),
