(1802227, 242826, 5112, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mita:</b></div><hr/><i> a proud history...?...in extermination of native americans ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought and thought about the title, and hoped that noone would find it offensive.<br/> <br/>I decided to keep the title because it is a picture of what some consider a proud history, and as such the title is appropriate to the picture.  It''s a title for this picture, not a statement about what happened in history.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by mita: a proud history...?...in extermination of native americans ?   I thought and thought about the title, and hoped that noone would find it offensive. I decided to keep the title because it is a picture of what some consider a proud history, and as such the title is appropriate to the picture.  It''s a title for this picture, not a statement about what happened in history.', '2005-10-21 21:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
