(1802648, 242895, 43360, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ScottK:</b></div><hr/><i> Two more tens.  If you keep this up, you''ll develop a cult following.  Every time they see an out-of-focus picture, they''ll immediately think "Ah, another piece by Sonej!" and score it a 10.  Of course, beware of the copy-cat artists - they''ll try to impersonate you.<br/> <br/>BTW, what is "catesse"? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>So I become famous? :)<br/> <br/>catesse is part of delicatessen</td>', 'Originally posted by ScottK: Two more tens.  If you keep this up, you''ll develop a cult following.  Every time they see an out-of-focus picture, they''ll immediately think "Ah, another piece by Sonej!" and score it a 10.  Of course, beware of the copy-cat artists - they''ll try to impersonate you. BTW, what is "catesse"?   So I become famous? :) catesse is part of delicatessen', '2005-10-22 03:25:41.000000', NULL, 0),
